  },
  "ingredients": [
    "10 1/2 ounce pork belly (thinly sliced)",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "1 tablespoon butter",
    "1/4 large onion (diced)",
    "4 tablespoon heavy whipping cream",
    "1.76 ounce blue cheese",
    "black pepper (to taste)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Turn oven to its highest setting on bake or fan forced, if you have it. Somewhere around 475F is what we are looking for.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/crispy-keto-pork-bites/#wprm-recipe-52249-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/06/crispy-pork-bites-01.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Take the pork belly strips and place in an ovenproof dish. Rub in the salt (fine salt like table salt works best). Ensure the pork belly is covered in a thin layer of salt. Bake the pork strips for approx. 30-45 minutes. Keep an eye on them; you need to cook them enough while not burning them. They will turn a lovely crispy golden brown color and you will see the fat will render out.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/crispy-keto-pork-bites/#wprm-recipe-52249-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/06/crispy-pork-bites-02.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a saucepan begin to melt the butter over medium heat, then add diced onion. You want to caramelize the onions slowly, so they are translucent and nice and sweet.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/crispy-keto-pork-bites/#wprm-recipe-52249-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/06/crispy-pork-bites-04.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once the onion is cooked, keep the heat on medium and add the cream.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/crispy-keto-pork-bites/#wprm-recipe-52249-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/06/crispy-pork-bites-05.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once cream is warmed through, crumble the blue cheese in and wait for it to melt.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/crispy-keto-pork-bites/#wprm-recipe-52249-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/06/crispy-pork-bites-06.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "When the cheese is melted increase to high heat for a minute or two, then pour into a dish.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/crispy-keto-pork-bites/#wprm-recipe-52249-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/06/crispy-pork-bites-07.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Take the pork out of the oven and allow to cool on a paper towel. Cut into bite size pieces.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/crispy-keto-pork-bites/#wprm-recipe-52249-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/06/crispy-pork-bites-08.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve with sauce and enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/crispy-keto-pork-bites/#wprm-recipe-52249-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
